WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.467
-Guys, it is time for
"Bad Signs."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.934
Here we go.

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:07.934
♪♪

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:12.267
-♪ Bad signs ♪

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:14.567
-"Bad Signs" is filmed
before a live studio audience.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.300
-These are pictures of
funny or weird signs

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:20.901
that you guys saw
and sent into us.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.334
And these are all real.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:26.701
This first one was sent in by
Matt Zaleck in Phoenix, Arizona.

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:28.801
It's a sign for a new restaurant
that he spotted.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:30.834
Let's see what it said.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:33.300
It's called Just Tacos and More.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.567
That's it.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:38.767
-That's all you got?
You got tacos?

00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:39.701
-We got burgers too.
You got pizza.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:41.000
-Oh, okay.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.400
-Whatever you want.
-Do you have sushi?

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.434
-Just tacos.

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.133
You heard me the first time,
right?

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:47.000
-Sushi?
-Yeah, of course we have sushi.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.467
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:50.934
This next one is from Patrick
Bender in Bayonne, New Jersey.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:52.367
Hey.
-Hey.

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:54.767
-He was shopping at Rite Aid
and spotted this amazing deal.

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:55.934
Look at this.

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:58.667
"Buy zero, get zero
at zero percent off."

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:02.767
Sold!

00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:05.000
-Where do I sign?
-That's a deal.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.000
This next one was sent in by
Bradley Nell in Dallas, Texas.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.300
He was shopping in a department
store and saw this sign.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.667
"For your convenience, an
elevator is located in China."

00:01:13.667 --> 00:01:15.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:16.667
So simple.
-Oh, what do you do?

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:18.167
-Go to the airport, it's
an international flight,

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:19.701
so you got to go a couple hours
ahead of time,

00:01:19.701 --> 00:01:21.701
and go all the way to China and
then you can take the elevator.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.601
-Oh, my God.
-Very convenient.

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:27.000
This next one is sent in
from Kate Van Perren in Georgia.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.734
She was out to eat with her kids
and spotted this great offer.

00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:33.033
"Your favorite kids eat free
on Sundays."

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.767
"Not so fast. You can go."

00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:38.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:40.167
-"You can go to Just Tacos."

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.501
-"You can go to Just Tacos.
There's more.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.467
They have more than just tacos."

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:46.734
This next one is from Austin
Haven in Grand Rapids, Michigan.

00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:50.000
He was vacationing in Australia
and spotted this sign on a tram

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.200
he was about to get on.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.367
It says...

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:54.534
"Touching wires causes
instant death.

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:56.067
$200 fine."

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:59.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:01.634
-I don't want to pay that $200.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:02.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.634 --> 00:02:05.133
-Good luck collecting.
-Yeah.

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:09.033
-This next one was sent in by
Rainer from Dresden, Germany.

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:11.300
He was eating at a restaurant
and went to use the bathroom

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:14.434
and he saw a social-distancing
sign telling you where to stand.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:15.467
Look at this.

00:02:15.467 --> 00:02:19.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:22.467
For Spider-Man, maybe.
-Yeah.

00:02:22.467 --> 00:02:26.300
-Next one was sent in by Judd
Kirk in Yorba Linda, California.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.901
It's a new business
that he spotted

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:30.567
in a strip mall near his house.

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.634
It says, "pediatric tattoos."

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:35.734
-Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:38.067
-Wow. Kids are getting into it.

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:40.367
Yeah. They love it.
-Only for your favorite kids.

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:41.567
-Oh, yeah.

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:44.267
This next one was sent in
by Josh Marchant in Utah.

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:46.634
He was visiting a park
and saw this sign.

00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:48.000
Look at this.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.968
"Please do not sit on fence."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:52.367
-Ouch!

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:55.033
-How could you possibly sit
on that fence?

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:56.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.234 --> 00:02:57.400
-Look at those curved blades.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.167
-It's almost like a fish hook.

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:02.300
It's a cruel fence.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.067
This next one was sent in
by Howard Tanner

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.400
in Adrian, Michigan.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:06.968
He was shopping in a pharmacy

00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:09.300
and spotted this sign
right here.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.801
"Fun gift ideas."

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:12.634
Let's see what they had.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:14.067
It's a bowl of Vaseline.
-Oh!

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:15.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.901 --> 00:03:17.934
For the people who want to
sit on the fence.

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.434
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:25.000
Finally, this last one was
from Michaela Strausba

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.834
in Indianapolis, Indiana.

00:03:26.834 --> 00:03:28.767
She spotted it while driving.

00:03:28.767 --> 00:03:31.200
The place is called
Beautiful Beginnings.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.267
"Closing sale."

00:03:32.267 --> 00:03:33.501
[ Laughter ]
There you go.

00:03:33.501 --> 00:03:35.434
That's all the time we have
for "Bad Signs."

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:36.901
If you see a funny sign,

00:03:36.901 --> 00:03:39.734
e-mail it to us at
badsigns@tonightshow.com.

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:40.968
We might put it on the show.

